C=======================================================================
C  MAP_CV2SAPRC22.EXT
C  This include file contains conversion table for 201 speciated species
C  to SAPRC22 (CMAQ) species
C
C
C  MEGAN v3
C
C  History:
C  Who                    When       What
C  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
C  Tan                    07/18/11 - Created for MEGANv2.10
C  Ling Huang             06/13/17 - Updated for MEGANv3
C  Prakash Karamchandani  05/14/25 - Updated for SAPRC22
C  Prakash Karamchandani  05/15/25 - Increase character size for SPMH_NAM variable
C=================================================================================

